Error [E0112]: `Cell<fn() => Int>.get()` cannot copy its value
  --> tests/ui/local_cell_copy_law.jet:2:15
    |
  2 |     _ :: cell.get()
    |               ^^^
 Why: `get` returns an independent owned value, so the stored type must support copying
 Fix: use `.read(value => ...)` to inspect it without making a copy

Error [E0112]: `Cell<[fn() => Int]?>.get_or_set()` cannot copy its value
  --> tests/ui/local_cell_copy_law.jet:6:15
    |
  6 |     _ :: cell.get_or_set(() => [() => 1])
    |               ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `get_or_set` returns an independent owned value, so `T` must support copying
 Fix: use `.edit(value => ...)` when the cached value cannot be copied
